  "note": "These fingerprints detect drift; they DO NOT prove staging parity, restore integrity, RLS authorization, or document clinical/legal safety. Now covers FK catalog fingerprints and effective table grants for anon/authenticated; still excludes raw ACL/column grants, function dependencies, Auth, Storage, data rows. Policy signature roles are normalized by role name rather than OID to support cross-database comparison. Definition string formatting may still differ across environments.",
